      "text": "日本拥有近七千个岛屿，最大的是本州岛，这让日本成为了世界第七大岛国。 In principle, the Tibetan Buddhism is very simple. It consists of Kundalini Yoga, meditation, and the path of all-embracing love. However,大多数指示牌都只使用加泰罗尼亚语，因为这是法律规定的第一官方语言。 New Kingdom ancient Egyptians marvelled at the predecessors' monuments, which were then well over a thousand years old. 奥克兰横跨两个港口，因此当地有很多海滩。 其中最有人气的海滩分布在三个地区。 该 park 覆盖 19,500 公里，并被分为 14 个不同的 ecosystems，以支持不同的 wildlife。区域下旬报告了本季的第一批病例。 Members of a subculture often signal their membership through a distinctive and symbolic use of style, which includes fashions, mannerism, and argot.菲律宾一名前警察在首都马尼拉劫持旅游大巴，将车上的香港游客作为人质。 Then Laka seen took the lead in singing the Bajans. 当地政府警告核电站附近的居民要待在室内，关掉空调，不要喝自来水。 Inland waterways can be a good theme to base a holiday around.",
